- `Deploy` — clone/pull, secrets, `.env`, Docker secrets, Caddy-labeled compose override with `com.herald.preview=<id>` for image pruning, `docker compose up`.
- `Teardown` / `Remove` — `docker compose down --volumes --remove-orphans`, image prune, directory removal, state cleanup.
- `List` — reads `previews.json`.
- `Cleanup` — checks remote with `git ls-remote --heads`, removes stale previews.
- Mutex-protected state reads/writes; max 10 previews per app enforced.

**`internal/preview/manager_test.go`** — unit tests for subdomain derivation, truncation, lowercase, no-leading-trailing-hyphens, `makeID`, and state roundtrip/atomic-write.

