**`internal/webhook/server.go`** — added `OnPreviewDeploy` / `OnPreviewTeardown` callbacks; `handlePreviewEvent` method dispatches on push (feature branch vs. deletion) and PR (opened/synchronize vs. closed). Preview events are independent of production app matching — they fire even when no production app matches.

**`cmd/preview.go`** — replaced stub with `herald preview list` (tabwriter table), `herald preview remove <id>`, and `herald preview cleanup`.

